    <bpmn:process id="W_W2682" name="W2682. Consumer Protection Compliance (RA 7394)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DTI complaint or compliance review
Frequency: Continuous; ad-hoc for complaints
Volume: 200 stores + ecommerce
Owner: Legal Compliance Officer
Participants: Legal Compliance Officer, Store Manager, Customer Service, DTI
Source: workflow W2682 — Consumer Protection Compliance (RA 7394)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2682_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2682_Lane1" name="Legal Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2682_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2682_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2682_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2682_Lane2" name="Customer Service">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2682_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2682_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2682_Start4" name="DTI complaint or compliance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2682_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2682_Task5" name="Legal Compliance Officer ensures ongoing compliance with the Consumer Act (RA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal Compliance Officer ensures ongoing compliance with the Consumer Act (RA 7394): accurate price tags (links to VS-08 / W69 price-compliance audit), clearly-posted return policy, no deceptive practices, honest advertising (the &quot;Per DTI Permit No.&quot; requirement on promos per W868), proper product labeling
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2682_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2682_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2682_Task6" name="Customer Service handles DTI-filed complaints: investigates, proposes a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer Service handles DTI-filed complaints: investigates, proposes a resolution (refund, replacement), represents BuildRight at DTI mediation; tracks the resolution-rate target (within 15 days per DTI&#x27;s standard expectation)
Responsible (R): Customer Service / Legal Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per complaint</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2682_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2682_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2682_Task7" name="Officer analyzes complaint trends: by store, category, complaint type…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Officer analyzes complaint trends: by store, category, complaint type; identifies high-complaint stores for improvement; reports quarterly to VP Legal and links repeat issues to the VS-23 loss-prevention or VS-118 pricing-integrity workflows where relevant
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2682_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2682_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2682_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2682_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2682_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-37: warranty claim validity — DTI often surfaces warranty disputes; operational: Legal Compliance Officer sign-off on any DTI-mediated settlement
Owner: Legal Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2682_Assoc10" sourceRef="W2682_Annotation9" targetRef="W2682_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
